-- חוזה מיום 27.12.84 — קופת תגמולים וקרן מיוחדת לעובדי הוראה, "דפנה": the
-- contract between the employers (the State and the Centre of Local
-- Government), ארגון המורים בבתי הספר העל-יסודיים and Bank Massad, by
-- which the bank sets up "Dafna", a provident fund for benefits and
-- severance for teaching employees, and runs it under a representatives'
-- committee (§§1–9), for a year from 1.10.84 renewing itself (§10), its
-- terms to enter the company's articles (§11). Its annexes: א', the summary
-- of 28.3.84 that the contributions come from — the 13⅓% arrangement on
-- work in an additional position ends on 31.8.84 with a special one-time
-- payment to one retiring with severance, and from 1.9.84 the employer and
-- the teacher each pay 5% of the pay for the additional position into a
-- benefits fund and the employer 8⅓% more into a special fund — and its
-- rules for the special payment; ב', the company's memorandum; ג', its
-- articles, whose §17 is the plan.
--
-- WHO CITES IT ("הסכם דפנה"): the base agreement of 25.12.2008, §33(ד)(4)
-- and §72(ג) — 13⅓% from the employer (8⅓% severance, 5% benefits) and 5%
-- from the teacher on the pay beyond a full position — and the
-- kindergarten-cluster managers' agreement of 17.6.2021, §6(ד), which
-- imports this file. The base agreement's rates are held to it in
-- l4/tests/1984-12-27_oz-latmura_dafna-provident-fund-tests.l4. It speaks to
-- no pay item of l4/lib/vocabulary.l4 and is not in oz-latmura-root.l4.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT vocabulary

§ `חוזה — קופת תגמולים וקרן מיוחדת לעובדי הוראה, "דפנה" (27.12.1984)`

@desc Who the Dafna contract gives a right to or puts a duty on.
DECLARE `Dafna contract party` IS ONE OF
    `Bank Massad, for Dafna`
    `the Dafna company`
    `the Dafna representatives' committee`
    `the employers, for Dafna`
    `a Dafna member`
    `a Dafna employer`
    `the Dafna directors`

DECLARE `Dafna action` IS ONE OF
    `set up the Dafna company`
    `obtain the approvals to run Dafna as a provident fund`
    `act by the provident-fund law and the committee's directions, for Dafna`
    `appoint representatives to the Dafna committee`
    `direct the Dafna company on a listed matter`
    `transfer the bank's Dafna shares`
    `wind up the Dafna company`
    `invest the Dafna money by the law`
    `keep an account for each Dafna member`
    `keep the Dafna company's other accounts`
    `file the Dafna company's reports`
    `send the Dafna members their reports`
    `compensate Dafna for the bank's negligence`
    `give notice to end the Dafna contract`
    `transfer the Dafna shares to whom the parties direct`
    `make the Dafna contract part of the company's articles`
    `pay into the Dafna benefits account`
    `pay into the Dafna special account`
    `discriminate between Dafna members`
    `transfer or pledge a Dafna member's rights`
    `distribute a Dafna dividend`

-- akn:preamble The contract's frame: a label row with no text of its own.
