-- akn:preamble/p7 ארגון המורים בבתי הספר העל-יסודיים, בסמינרים ובמיכללות, "on the second side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p8 Bank Massad Ltd.; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p9 The bank's short name, "on the third side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p12 The words of agreement that introduce the clauses; no rule.

-- ¶3: made in Tel Aviv on 27.12.84.
@ref akn:preamble/p3
`the Dafna contract was signed on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 27 12 1984

-- ¶10: the employers agreed with הסתדרות המורים and ארגון המורים ("the
-- employees' organisation") to set up a benefits fund and a special fund
-- for teaching employees, for the payments made under the summary of
-- 28.3.84 (annex א'); ¶11: the experts' committee set up under that
-- summary decided the fund and the special fund are managed for every
-- teaching employee at the bank.
@ref akn:preamble/p10 akn:preamble/p11
`the summary Dafna's contributions come from was signed on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 28 3 1984
`Dafna is managed at the bank for every teaching employee` MEANS TRUE

§§ `1–2 הקמת החברה`

-- §1: the bank sets up "Dafna" — a provident fund for benefits and
-- severance for teaching employees Ltd. (the company), its memorandum and
-- articles annexes ב' and ג'; the bank controls it, and it is run as this
-- contract sets out. §2: the bank obtains the approvals to run it as a
-- provident fund for benefits and severance.
@ref akn:art_1 akn:art_2
`setting up Dafna` MEANS
    PARTY `Bank Massad, for Dafna`
    MUST  `set up the Dafna company`
    HENCE (PARTY `Bank Massad, for Dafna`
           MUST  `obtain the approvals to run Dafna as a provident fund`)

`the bank controls the Dafna company` MEANS TRUE

§§ `3 ועדת הנציגים`

-- (א): the company and the bank act by their best judgment and by the law
-- on provident funds, subject to the representatives' committee's
-- directions through its secretariat.
@ref akn:art_3 akn:art_3__para_a
`acting by the Dafna committee's directions` MEANS
    PARTY `Bank Massad, for Dafna`
    MUST  `act by the provident-fund law and the committee's directions, for Dafna`

-- (ב)(1): each party appoints representatives to the committee — the
-- Ministry of Education two (one the Ministry's accountant's), the
-- Treasury one, the Centre of Local Government one, הסתדרות המורים two,
-- ארגון המורים two; the bank one, with an advisory voice only.
@ref akn:art_3__para_b akn:art_3__para_b__subpara_1 akn:art_3__para_b__subpara_1/p2 akn:art_3__para_b__subpara_1/p3 akn:art_3__para_b__subpara_1/p4 akn:art_3__para_b__subpara_1/p5 akn:art_3__para_b__subpara_1/p6 akn:art_3__para_b__subpara_1/p7
`the employers' representatives on the Dafna committee` MEANS LIST 2, 1, 1
`the employees' representatives on the Dafna committee` MEANS LIST 2, 2
`the bank's advisory representatives on the Dafna committee` MEANS 1

-- (2): the employees' organisations' representatives together may vote
-- only unanimously, on the one side, and the employers' likewise on the
-- other: each side votes as one. With two sides and no casting vote, the
-- committee decides what both sides vote for.
@ref akn:art_3__para_b__subpara_2
GIVEN `the employees' representatives for` IS A NUMBER, `the employees' representatives present` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a Dafna side votes for` `the employees' representatives for` `the employees' representatives present` IF
    `the employees' representatives present` GREATER THAN 0
    AND `the employees' representatives for` EQUALS `the employees' representatives present`

GIVEN `the employees' side votes for` IS A BOOLEAN, `the employers' side votes for` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the Dafna committee decides` `the employees' side votes for` `the employers' side votes for` IF
    `the employees' side votes for` AND `the employers' side votes for`

-- (3): the Ministry of Education's representative chairs it; (4): he, the
-- Ministry's accountant's representative and one representative of each
-- employees' organisation are the secretariat.
@ref akn:art_3__para_b__subpara_3 akn:art_3__para_b__subpara_4
`the Dafna secretariat's members` MEANS 4

-- (5): the committee, through the secretariat, directs the company, and
-- the bank follows, on (א) investments the law does not settle, (ב)
-- insurance for members, (ג) loans to members, (ד) reports beyond the law
-- at the company's cost, (ה) appointing an auditor, (ו) appointing an
-- internal auditor, (ז) the company's other actions.
@ref akn:art_3__para_b__subpara_5 akn:art_3__para_b__subpara_5__cls_a akn:art_3__para_b__subpara_5__cls_b akn:art_3__para_b__subpara_5__cls_c akn:art_3__para_b__subpara_5__cls_d akn:art_3__para_b__subpara_5__cls_e akn:art_3__para_b__subpara_5__cls_f akn:art_3__para_b__subpara_5__cls_g
DECLARE `Dafna committee matter` IS ONE OF
    `investments the law does not settle, for Dafna`
    `insurance for Dafna members`
    `loans to Dafna members`
    `reports beyond the law, for Dafna`
    `appointing Dafna's auditor`
    `appointing Dafna's internal auditor`
    `Dafna's other actions`

GIVEN m IS A `Dafna committee matter`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the Dafna committee directs the company on` m IF TRUE

`directing Dafna` MEANS
    PARTY `the Dafna representatives' committee`
    MAY   `direct the Dafna company on a listed matter`

§§ `4–5 ייעוד החברה ומניותיה`

-- §4: the company serves only as a provident fund under this contract.
-- §5: the bank does not transfer its shares, nor wind the company up,
-- unless the other parties and the other employees' organisation agree.
@ref akn:art_4 akn:art_5
`the Dafna company serves only as a provident fund` MEANS TRUE

GIVEN `the other parties and the other organisation agree` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the bank may transfer its Dafna shares or wind Dafna up` `the other parties and the other organisation agree` IF
    `the other parties and the other organisation agree`

`the bank keeps its Dafna shares` MEANS
    PARTY `Bank Massad, for Dafna`
    SHANT `transfer the bank's Dafna shares`

§§ `6 הבנק כמנהל עסקים`

-- The bank is the company's business manager and, as trustee and subject
-- to §3(א), sees that the company (א) invests by the law, by its
-- professional judgment and the committee's directions where the law does
-- not settle the investment — the investment the basis of keeping a yield
-- of at least 4.5%, provided bond yields do not worsen and the investment
-- rules do not change; (ב) keeps an account for each member, benefits
-- apart from severance; (ג) keeps its other accounts; (ד) files its
-- reports; (ה) sends members their reports.
@ref akn:art_6 akn:art_6__para_a akn:art_6__para_b akn:art_6__para_c akn:art_6__para_d akn:art_6__para_e
`the yield Dafna's investment is to keep` MEANS 4.5%

GIVEN `the yield` IS A NUMBER, `bond yields worsened` IS A BOOLEAN, `the investment rules changed` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Dafna keeps the yield §6(א) asks` `the yield` `bond yields worsened` `the investment rules changed` IF
       `bond yields worsened`
    OR `the investment rules changed`
    OR `the yield` AT LEAST `the yield Dafna's investment is to keep`

`managing Dafna's business` MEANS
    PARTY `Bank Massad, for Dafna`
    MUST  `invest the Dafna money by the law`
    HENCE (PARTY `Bank Massad, for Dafna`
           MUST  `keep an account for each Dafna member`)

§§ `7–9 רווחים, דמי ניהול ופיצוי`

-- §7: how profits are credited and what members are paid on retiring are
-- set subject to the law. §8: the bank charges the company a management
-- fee of 0.7% a year of the revalued balance of its assets, in advances at
-- the end of each quarter. §9: the bank compensates the company for damage
-- its negligence causes.
@ref akn:art_7 akn:art_8 akn:art_9
`the Dafna management fee` MEANS 0.7%
`months between Dafna fee advances` MEANS 3

GIVEN `the revalued assets` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the Dafna management fee for a year` `the revalued assets` IS
    `the Dafna management fee` TIMES `the revalued assets`

GIVEN `the bank was negligent` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `Dafna contract party` `Dafna action`
DECIDE `the bank's liability to Dafna` `the bank was negligent` IS
    IF `the bank was negligent`
    THEN PARTY `Bank Massad, for Dafna`
         MUST  `compensate Dafna for the bank's negligence`
    ELSE FULFILLED

`why the provident-fund law is not in the Dafna contract` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "תקנות מס הכנסה (כללים לאישור ולניהול קופות גמל), התשכ\"ד-1964, ופקודת מס הכנסה"

§§ `10 תקופת החוזה`

-- (א): a year from 1.10.84, renewing itself for a further year and so on,
-- unless a party gives the others notice, no later than three months
-- before the current term ends, that it wishes to end it.
@ref akn:art_10 akn:art_10__para_a
GIVEN `years since 1.10.84` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `the Dafna term that began that year ends on` `years since 1.10.84` IS
    DATE_FROM_DMY 30 9 (1985 PLUS `years since 1.10.84`)

GIVEN `years since 1.10.84` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `the last day for notice to end that Dafna term` `years since 1.10.84` IS
    DATE_FROM_DMY 30 6 (1985 PLUS `years since 1.10.84`)

GIVEN `notice given on` IS A DATE, `years since 1.10.84` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the notice ends the Dafna contract at that term's end` `notice given on` `years since 1.10.84` IF
    `notice given on` `is on or before` (`the last day for notice to end that Dafna term` `years since 1.10.84`)

-- (ב): once it ends, the bank, if the parties ask, transfers its shares to
-- whom they direct, against its investment in the capital and the setting
-- up, linked to the consumer price index.
@ref akn:art_10__para_b
GIVEN `the bank's investment` IS A NUMBER, `the index on transfer` IS A NUMBER, `the index on investment` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `what the bank is repaid for its Dafna shares` `the bank's investment` `the index on transfer` `the index on investment` IS
    `the bank's investment` TIMES `the index on transfer` DIVIDED BY `the index on investment`

§§ `11 החוזה בתקנון`

@ref akn:art_11
`the Dafna contract into the articles` MEANS
    PARTY `Bank Massad, for Dafna`
    MUST  `make the Dafna contract part of the company's articles`

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:conclusions/p1 The signing formula; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/t1 The parties signing: the Government, the Centre of Local Government, ארגון המורים and Bank Massad; no rule.

§§ `נספח א' — סיכום הדברים מיום 28.3.84`

-- akn:attachments The annexes' frame: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1/p1 The summary's title ("סיכום דברים"); no rule.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1/p2 The committee under §18 of annex א' of the special collective agreement of 16.11.83; no rule.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1/p3 The opening: the employers' claim under the agreements of 19 and 20.1.1983 and §18 of annex א' of 16.11.1983 (outside the corpus) was discussed; no rule.

-- 1(א): the arrangement on the eve — the employer's 13⅓% for work in an
-- additional position as §27 of the agreement of 22.2.79 defines it
-- (outside the corpus) — is the full and final compensation for that work
-- and for the social rights not given beyond one full position, severance
-- and pension included.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1__para_1 akn:att_1__hc_1__para_1__subpara_a
`the Dafna summary's old contribution rate` MEANS 40/3 DIVIDED BY 100

`why the earlier extra-position agreements are not in the Dafna contract` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "ההסכמים הקיבוציים מיום 22.2.79 (סעיף 27), 19.1.1983, 20.1.1983 ו־16.11.1983 (נספח א', סעיף 18)"

-- 1(ב): notwithstanding, a teacher retiring from the summary's signing on
-- in circumstances entitling him to severance gets from his employer,
-- besides severance for his full position, a special one-time payment for
-- the additional position. 1(ג): the difference between 8⅓% of the pay he
-- had for the additional position with that employer from 1.9.74 to
-- 31.8.84 (or to the end of his work, if earlier) and what the employer's
-- 13⅓% contributions saved for him, ¶2 all of it — principal, interest,
-- linkage, grants; ¶3 computed by the rules annexed (below).
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b akn:att_1__hc_1__para_1__subpara_c akn:att_1__hc_1__para_1__subpara_c/p2 akn:att_1__hc_1__para_1__subpara_c/p3
`the special payment's rate` MEANS 25/3 DIVIDED BY 100

GIVEN `retired on` IS A DATE, `entitled to severance` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `owed the Dafna summary's special payment` `retired on` `entitled to severance` IF
    `entitled to severance` AND `retired on` `is on or after` `the summary Dafna's contributions come from was signed on`

GIVEN `pay for the additional position, 1.9.74–31.8.84` IS A NUMBER, `saved from the 13⅓%` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the special payment by 1(ג)` `pay for the additional position, 1.9.74–31.8.84` `saved from the 13⅓%` IS
    `the special payment's rate` TIMES `pay for the additional position, 1.9.74–31.8.84` MINUS `saved from the 13⅓%`

-- 2(א): the old arrangement expires on 31.8.84, 1(א)–(ג) remaining in
-- force. (ב): teachers get what was saved for them in the 13⅓% funds to
-- 31.8.84 by its rules, though nothing more is paid into them.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1__para_2 akn:att_1__hc_1__para_2__subpara_a akn:att_1__hc_1__para_2__subpara_b
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the Dafna summary's old arrangement is in force on` d IF
    d `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 1984)

-- 3(א): from 1.9.84 a new arrangement in its place. (ב): the employer and
-- the teacher each pay 5% of the pay for an additional position into a
-- benefits fund; ¶2 the teacher gets it on retiring in circumstances
-- entitling him to benefits, as the experts' committee sets. (ג): the
-- employer pays a further 8⅓% of that pay into the special fund.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1__para_3 akn:att_1__hc_1__para_3__subpara_a akn:att_1__hc_1__para_3__subpara_b akn:att_1__hc_1__para_3__subpara_b/p2 akn:att_1__hc_1__para_3__subpara_c
`the Dafna employer's benefits rate` MEANS 5%
`the Dafna teacher's benefits rate` MEANS 5%
`the Dafna employer's special-fund rate` MEANS 25/3 DIVIDED BY 100

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the Dafna new arrangement is in force on` d IF
    d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 1984)

GIVEN d IS A DATE, `pay for the additional position` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the Dafna employer's contributions` d `pay for the additional position` IS
    IF `the Dafna new arrangement is in force on` d
    THEN (`the Dafna employer's benefits rate` PLUS `the Dafna employer's special-fund rate`) TIMES `pay for the additional position`
    ELSE `the Dafna summary's old contribution rate` TIMES `pay for the additional position`

GIVEN d IS A DATE, `pay for the additional position` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the Dafna teacher's contribution` d `pay for the additional position` IS
    IF `the Dafna new arrangement is in force on` d
    THEN `the Dafna teacher's benefits rate` TIMES `pay for the additional position`
    ELSE 0

-- The employer's share under the new arrangement is the old 13⅓%, split
-- 5% benefits and 8⅓% special.
#ASSERT `the Dafna employer's benefits rate` PLUS `the Dafna employer's special-fund rate` EQUALS `the Dafna summary's old contribution rate`

-- (ד): the details are worked out by a joint experts' committee, subject
-- to the tax rules on provident funds, within two months of the signing.
-- (ה): the new arrangement is the full and final compensation for work in
-- an additional position and the social rights not given for it.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1__para_3__subpara_d akn:att_1__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e
`the Dafna experts' committee finishes by` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 28 5 1984
`the Dafna new arrangement is the full compensation for the additional position` MEANS TRUE

-- 4: neither arrangement (א) limits the parity committees' power over
-- payments on ending service in special cases, (ב) changes the rules of
-- current pay for an additional position, its components and pay in the
-- holidays, (ג) takes away rights expressly given for it (the sick-day
-- account of one in an additional position, say), or (ד) changes either
-- side's arguments on employing teachers beyond one position.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1__para_4 akn:att_1__hc_1__para_4__subpara_a akn:att_1__hc_1__para_4__subpara_b akn:att_1__hc_1__para_4__subpara_c akn:att_1__hc_1__para_4__subpara_d
`the Dafna arrangements change the current pay for an additional position` MEANS FALSE
`the Dafna arrangements limit the parity committees` MEANS FALSE

-- 5: the claims of the two organisations not agreed — (א) the special
-- payment to those retiring on a pension too, (ב) for work from 1.9.70 and
-- not 1.9.74, (ג) deposits monthly with the salary, interest and linkage
-- on a late one, (ד) for work with earlier employers, at least 4 years —
-- ¶2 go to Mr. Nachman Ori as sole arbitrator under the deed annexed,
-- which the corpus does not hold. Not agreed, they are no rule here.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1__para_5 akn:att_1__hc_1__para_5__subpara_a akn:att_1__hc_1__para_5__subpara_b akn:att_1__hc_1__para_5__subpara_c akn:att_1__hc_1__para_5__subpara_c/p2 akn:att_1__hc_1__para_5__subpara_d akn:att_1__hc_1__para_5/p2
`the claims the Dafna summary sends to arbitration` MEANS 4

`why the Dafna arbitration is not in the Dafna contract` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "שטר הבוררות לפני מר נחמן אורי כבורר יחיד, ופסק הבורר"

-- 6: disputes on the summary go the way the existing agreements settle
-- them.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1__para_6
`Dafna summary disputes go by the existing agreements` MEANS TRUE

-- akn:att_1__hc_1/p4 The signing formula, dated 28.3.84; no rule.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1/t1 The summary's signatories; no rule.

§§ `כללים לחישוב התשלום המיוחד`

-- akn:att_1__att_1__hc_1/p1 The title of the rules; no rule.

-- A1: the pay for the additional position from 1.9.74 to 31.8.84, by the
-- teacher's average actual work in it with his last employer, at its
-- value on 31.8.84, at the grade and seniority he had that day; A2: the
-- same at its value on the day of payment; B: what was saved for him in
-- the 13⅓% fund for his work with the last employer to 31.8.84; C: the
-- special payment on 31.8.84, A1 × 8.33 / 100 − B; D: the payment on the
-- day it is paid, printed "A X C/A1 = D2".
-- F-oz-dafna-1984-a: C multiplies by 8.33 where 1(ג) says 8⅓%. Read by
-- the rules, which 1(ג) says the payment is computed by (convention
-- precedence.specific).
-- F-oz-dafna-1984-b: D's line names an "A" and a "D2" the rules never
-- define; read as A2 and D (convention reading.misprint): C carried from
-- 31.8.84's value of the pay to the day of payment's.
@ref akn:att_1__att_1__hc_1/p2 akn:att_1__att_1__hc_1/p3 akn:att_1__att_1__hc_1/p4 akn:att_1__att_1__hc_1/p5 akn:att_1__att_1__hc_1/p6 akn:att_1__att_1__hc_1/p7 akn:att_1__att_1__hc_1/p8 akn:att_1__att_1__hc_1/p9 akn:att_1__att_1__hc_1/p10 akn:att_1__att_1__hc_1/p11 akn:att_1__att_1__hc_1/p12
`the rate the special payment's rules print` MEANS 8.33%

GIVEN A1 IS A NUMBER, B IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the Dafna special payment on 31.8.84` A1 B IS
    A1 TIMES `the rate the special payment's rules print` MINUS B

GIVEN A1 IS A NUMBER, A2 IS A NUMBER, B IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the Dafna special payment on the day it is paid` A1 A2 B IS
    A2 TIMES (`the Dafna special payment on 31.8.84` A1 B) DIVIDED BY A1

-- F-oz-dafna-1984-a's evidence: the rules' rate is not 1(ג)'s 8⅓%.
`the special payment's rules print 8.33 where 1(ג) says 8⅓` MEANS
    NOT (`the rate the special payment's rules print` EQUALS `the special payment's rate`)
#ASSERT `the special payment's rules print 8.33 where 1(ג) says 8⅓`

-- F-oz-dafna-1984-b's evidence: the symbols the rules define, and those
-- D's line uses.
`the symbols the Dafna rules define` MEANS LIST "A1", "A2", "B", "C", "D"
`the symbols D's line of the Dafna rules uses` MEANS LIST "A", "C", "A1", "D2"
`D's line of the Dafna rules uses symbols the rules never define` MEANS
        (NOT elem "A" `the symbols the Dafna rules define`)
    AND (NOT elem "D2" `the symbols the Dafna rules define`)
    AND elem "A" `the symbols D's line of the Dafna rules uses`
    AND elem "D2" `the symbols D's line of the Dafna rules uses`
#ASSERT `D's line of the Dafna rules uses symbols the rules never define`

§§ `נספח ב' — תזכיר ההתאגדות`

-- The memorandum under the Companies Ordinance (New Version), 1983: a
-- private company limited by shares; ¶1 its name; ¶2 its objects, (א) a
-- severance fund and (ב) a benefits fund for employees, ¶2 by the
-- authorities' rules on approved funds; ¶3 its members' liability is
-- limited; ¶4 its capital is 500,000 shekels in 500,000 shares of 1
-- shekel; the subscribers — Bank Massad 9,999 shares, the Hapoalim trust
-- company 1.
@ref akn:att_2__hc_1/p1 akn:att_2__hc_1/p2 akn:att_2__hc_1/p3 akn:att_2__hc_1/p4 akn:att_2__hc_1/p5 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_1 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_2 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_2__subpara_a akn:att_2__hc_1__para_2__subpara_b akn:att_2__hc_1__para_2/p2 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_3 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_4 akn:att_2__hc_1/p6 akn:att_2__hc_1/t1
`Dafna's share capital in shekels` MEANS 500000
`Dafna's shares` MEANS 500000
`Dafna's shares subscribed` MEANS LIST 9999, 1

#ASSERT sum `Dafna's shares subscribed` EQUALS 10000

`why the Companies Ordinance is not in the Dafna contract` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "פקודת החברות [נוסח חדש], התשמ\"ג-1983, והתוספת השנייה לה (הלוח)"

§§ `נספח ג' — תקנון ההתאגדות`

-- akn:att_3__hc_1/p1 The heading: the Companies Ordinance; no rule.
-- akn:att_3__hc_1/p2 A company limited by shares; no rule.
-- akn:att_3__hc_1/p3 The title, "articles of association"; no rule.
-- akn:att_3__hc_1/p4 "Of"; no rule.
-- akn:att_3__hc_1/p5 The company's name; no rule.

-- 1 (introduction): (א) the definitions — "the law" (the income-tax
-- provident-fund rules of 1964), the company, "the act" (the income-tax
-- ordinance, the rules and every law that may apply), these articles, the
-- ordinance, the fund, the bank, a member and an employer as the rules
-- define them; any other word as in the ordinance, the singular the
-- plural and persons bodies too; (ב) the ordinance's second schedule ("the
-- table") applies only where these articles name its rules; (ג) a private
-- company of no more than 50 members.
@ref akn:att_3__hc_1__para_1 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_1__subpara_a akn:att_3__hc_1__para_1__subpara_a/p2 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_1__subpara_a/p3 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_1__subpara_a/p4 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_1__subpara_a/p5 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_1__subpara_a/p6 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_1__subpara_a/p7 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_1__subpara_a/p8 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_1__subpara_a/p9 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_1__subpara_a/p10 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_1__subpara_a/p11 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b akn:att_3__hc_1__para_1__subpara_c
`Dafna's most shareholders` MEANS 50

GIVEN shareholders IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Dafna may have the shareholders` shareholders IF
    shareholders AT MOST `Dafna's most shareholders`

-- 2: (א) the capital, 500,000 ordinary shares of 1 shekel; (ב) no offer
-- to the public. 3: classes of shares as an extraordinary meeting sets.
-- 4: a class's rights change with the written consent, or an
-- extraordinary meeting's, of at least three quarters of its shares.
-- 5: shares are allotted only for their full nominal value in cash.
@ref akn:att_3__hc_1__para_2 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_2__subpara_a akn:att_3__hc_1__para_2__subpara_b akn:att_3__hc_1__para_3 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_3/p1 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_4 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_4/p1 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_5 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_5/p1
GIVEN `shares consenting` IS A NUMBER, `shares issued of the class` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a Dafna class's rights may change` `shares consenting` `shares issued of the class` IF
    `shares consenting` AT LEAST 3/4 TIMES `shares issued of the class`

#ASSERT `Dafna's share capital in shekels` EQUALS `Dafna's shares` TIMES 1

-- 6: (א) shares transfer only with the board's approval, which it may
-- refuse without reasons; (ב) by a deed signed by both, in force once the
-- board approves it and enters it in the register. 7: the table's rules
-- 41–44 (changes in capital) apply.
@ref akn:att_3__hc_1__para_6 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_6__subpara_a akn:att_3__hc_1__para_6__subpara_b akn:att_3__hc_1__para_7 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_7/p1
GIVEN `the board approved` IS A BOOLEAN, `entered in the register` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a Dafna share transfer is in force` `the board approved` `entered in the register` IF
    `the board approved` AND `entered in the register`

-- 8: (א) a general meeting once a year, no later than fifteen months
-- after the last, the others extraordinary; (ב) the table's rule 47
-- applies. 9: (א) seven days' notice of an ordinary meeting and
-- twenty-one of an extraordinary one, which the shareholders may shorten
-- in writing; (ב) an ordinary meeting approves the reports and accounts,
-- elects directors and appoints the auditors, all else at an
-- extraordinary one; (ג) the quorum: two shareholders holding together a
-- tenth of the issued capital; (ד) the meeting chooses its chairman.
@ref akn:att_3__hc_1__para_8 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_8__subpara_a akn:att_3__hc_1__para_8__subpara_a/p2 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_8__subpara_b akn:att_3__hc_1__para_9 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_9__subpara_a akn:att_3__hc_1__para_9__subpara_b akn:att_3__hc_1__para_9__subpara_b/p2 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_9__subpara_c akn:att_3__hc_1__para_9__subpara_d
`the most months between Dafna's yearly meetings` MEANS 15

GIVEN `an extraordinary meeting` IS A BOOLEAN, `the shareholders agreed to a shorter notice` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the days of notice of a Dafna meeting` `an extraordinary meeting` `the shareholders agreed to a shorter notice` IS
    BRANCH
        IF `the shareholders agreed to a shorter notice` THEN 0
        IF `an extraordinary meeting` THEN 21
        OTHERWISE 7

GIVEN `shareholders present` IS A NUMBER, `their share of the issued capital` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a Dafna meeting has its quorum` `shareholders present` `their share of the issued capital` IF
    `shareholders present` AT LEAST 2 AND `their share of the issued capital` AT LEAST 10%

-- 10: (א) a show of hands unless a member present asks for a poll; (ב) in
-- a poll a vote a share; (ג) in person, by proxy or a body's
-- representative; (ד) the proxy delivered by the meeting's opening. 11:
-- a written resolution of all shareholders is a meeting's resolution.
@ref akn:att_3__hc_1__para_10 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_10__subpara_a akn:att_3__hc_1__para_10__subpara_b akn:att_3__hc_1__para_10__subpara_c akn:att_3__hc_1__para_10__subpara_d akn:att_3__hc_1__para_11 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_11/p1
GIVEN shares IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the votes of Dafna shares in a poll` shares IS shares

-- 12: (א) the number of directors the meeting or a written resolution
-- sets; (ב) the table's rules 84–86 inclusive apply; (ג) no share needed
-- to qualify; (ד) the table's rule 71 applies; (ה) minutes, signed by the
-- chairman, are conclusive. 13: a director is elected by an ordinary
-- meeting for the term set, or until he ceases, or the meeting removes
-- him. 14: the table's rule 80 (disqualification) applies.
@ref akn:att_3__hc_1__para_12 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_12__subpara_a akn:att_3__hc_1__para_12__subpara_b akn:att_3__hc_1__para_12__subpara_c akn:att_3__hc_1__para_12__subpara_d akn:att_3__hc_1__para_12__subpara_e akn:att_3__hc_1__para_13 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_13/p1 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_14 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_14/p1
`a Dafna director must hold a share` MEANS FALSE

-- 15: (א) the directors run the business with all the company's powers
-- save those kept for the meeting; (ב) their quorum is what they set, or
-- three where there are more than three directors; (ג) they may delegate
-- and withdraw; (ד) a written resolution of all directors is a board's.
-- 16: the company's seal; two directors, or a director with one the board
-- authorised, or two authorised persons, with the seal or under its
-- printed name, bind the company.
@ref akn:att_3__hc_1__para_15 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_15__subpara_a akn:att_3__hc_1__para_15__subpara_b akn:att_3__hc_1__para_15__subpara_c akn:att_3__hc_1__para_15__subpara_d akn:att_3__hc_1__para_16 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_16/p1
GIVEN directors IS A NUMBER, `the quorum the directors set` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the quorum of Dafna's board` directors `the quorum the directors set` IS
    CONSIDER `the quorum the directors set`
    WHEN JUST q THEN JUST q
    WHEN NOTHING THEN (IF directors `is above` 3 THEN JUST 3 ELSE NOTHING)

-- Where the directors set no quorum and there are three or fewer, 15(ב)
-- gives none: the quorum is theirs to set.
`why a small Dafna board's quorum is not here` MEANS
    `set elsewhere` "הדירקטורים של דפנה (תקנה 15(ב) לתקנון ההתאגדות)"

GIVEN `directors signing` IS A NUMBER, `authorised persons signing` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `signatures bind Dafna` `directors signing` `authorised persons signing` IF
    `directors signing` PLUS `authorised persons signing` AT LEAST 2

-- 17, the plan: (א) the employer and the member each pay 5% of the pay for
-- an additional position into a benefits account; (ב) the member gets it
-- on ending his work with the employer; (ג) the employer pays 8⅓% of that
-- pay into a special account; (ד) the member gets it on ending his work
-- with the employer; (ה) the member's rights are computed with (1) the
-- base index, of the month of deposit, published on the 15th of the next;
-- (2) the determining index, the last known on the day of withdrawal; (3)
-- profit in the month of deposit, the תפ"ס rate from the day of deposit
-- to the month's end; (4) profit in the month of withdrawal, from the 16th
-- to the day of withdrawal; (5) the discount spread over each bond's
-- average life.
@ref akn:att_3__hc_1__para_17 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_17__subpara_a akn:att_3__hc_1__para_17__subpara_b akn:att_3__hc_1__para_17__subpara_c akn:att_3__hc_1__para_17__subpara_d
`the Dafna plan's benefits rate, each` MEANS 5%
`the Dafna plan's special-account rate` MEANS 25/3 DIVIDED BY 100

GIVEN `ended work with the employer` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a Dafna member may draw his accounts` `ended work with the employer` IF
    `ended work with the employer`

`paying into Dafna` MEANS
    (PARTY `a Dafna employer`
     MUST  `pay into the Dafna benefits account`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `a Dafna member`
     MUST  `pay into the Dafna benefits account`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `a Dafna employer`
     MUST  `pay into the Dafna special account`)

@ref akn:att_3__hc_1__para_17__subpara_e akn:att_3__hc_1__para_17__subpara_e__cls_1 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_17__subpara_e__cls_2 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_17__subpara_e__cls_3 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_17__subpara_e__cls_4 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_17__subpara_e__cls_5
GIVEN deposit IS A NUMBER, `the base index` IS A NUMBER, `the determining index` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a Dafna deposit linked to the index` deposit `the base index` `the determining index` IS
    deposit TIMES `the determining index` DIVIDED BY `the base index`

`the day the base index of Dafna is published` MEANS 15
`the day profit in the month of withdrawal runs from` MEANS 16

-- 18: (א) a member may draw what is due to him in the last five banking
-- days of each month; (ב) (1) a member paid by a fund is taxed on it — (א)
-- 35% if paid against the rules, even if exempt or taxed lower, (ב) at his
-- rate if paid on a winding-up the commissioner finds unjustified; (2) a
-- fund paying a taxable sum deducts (א) 35% under rule 3(1) and (ב) 25%
-- under rule 3(2).
@ref akn:att_3__hc_1__para_18 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_18__subpara_a akn:att_3__hc_1__para_18__subpara_b akn:att_3__hc_1__para_18__subpara_b__cls_1 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_18__subpara_b__cls_1__pnt_a akn:att_3__hc_1__para_18__subpara_b__cls_1__pnt_b akn:att_3__hc_1__para_18__subpara_b__cls_2 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_18__subpara_b__cls_2__pnt_a akn:att_3__hc_1__para_18__subpara_b__cls_2__pnt_b
`the banking days at a month's end a Dafna member may draw in` MEANS 5

DECLARE `Dafna taxable payment` IS ONE OF
    `taxable under rule 3(1), for Dafna`
    `taxable under rule 3(2), for Dafna`

GIVEN p IS A `Dafna taxable payment`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the tax Dafna deducts from` p IS
    CONSIDER p
    WHEN `taxable under rule 3(1), for Dafna` THEN 35%
    WHEN `taxable under rule 3(2), for Dafna` THEN 25%

`the tax on a Dafna payment against the rules` MEANS 35%

-- 19: on a member's death (א) the benefits account goes to whom he named,
-- ¶2 or else to his heirs by law; (ב) the special account to his
-- survivors under the Severance Pay Law (outside the corpus).
@ref akn:att_3__hc_1__para_19 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_19__subpara_a akn:att_3__hc_1__para_19__subpara_a/p2 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_19__subpara_b
DECLARE `who takes a Dafna account on death` IS ONE OF
    `the one the member named, for Dafna`
    `the heirs by law, for Dafna`
    `the survivors under the Severance Pay Law, for Dafna`

GIVEN `the special account` IS A BOOLEAN, `the member named someone` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `who takes a Dafna account on death`
DECIDE `who takes the Dafna account` `the special account` `the member named someone` IS
    BRANCH
        IF `the special account` THEN `the survivors under the Severance Pay Law, for Dafna`
        IF `the member named someone` THEN `the one the member named, for Dafna`
        OTHERWISE `the heirs by law, for Dafna`

`why the Severance Pay Law is not in the Dafna contract` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "חוק פיצויי פיטורים, התשכ\"ג-1963"

-- 20: the directors appoint the supervising body by law, and may replace
-- it with the approval the law asks. 21: the company sets the terms of
-- joining by the rules. 22: (א) a member fulfils the rules; (ב) he may not
-- transfer or pledge his rights, nor the company approve it, unless his
-- membership ended or the law allows it. 23: the directors make no
-- discrimination between members' rights.
@ref akn:att_3__hc_1__para_20 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_20/p1 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_21 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_21/p1 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_22 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_22__subpara_a akn:att_3__hc_1__para_22__subpara_b akn:att_3__hc_1__para_23 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_23/p1
GIVEN `membership ended` IS A BOOLEAN, `the law allows it` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a Dafna member may transfer or pledge his rights` `membership ended` `the law allows it` IF
    `membership ended` OR `the law allows it`

`no discrimination between Dafna members` MEANS
    PARTY `the Dafna directors`
    SHANT `discriminate between Dafna members`

-- 24: (א) the bank carries out the company's administration and finance
-- under a management agreement, for a fee of no more than 1% of the
-- revalued assets; (ב) it invests by the rules and keeps the accounts.
-- 25: the company does what the rules require and nothing they forbid,
-- and engages in nothing they do not expressly allow without approval.
-- 26: it invests by the rules.
@ref akn:att_3__hc_1__para_24 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_24__subpara_a akn:att_3__hc_1__para_24__subpara_b akn:att_3__hc_1__para_25 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_25__subpara_a akn:att_3__hc_1__para_25__subpara_b akn:att_3__hc_1__para_26 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_26/p1
`the most Dafna's management fee may be` MEANS 1%

GIVEN fee IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a Dafna management fee is within the articles` fee IF
    fee AT MOST `the most Dafna's management fee may be`

-- 27: (א) a decision to wind the fund up needs 75% of its members; (ב) what
-- is left after its debts is divided by the plan's rules. 28: (א) profits
-- cover the company's liabilities only; (ב) no dividends or benefits.
@ref akn:att_3__hc_1__para_27 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_27__subpara_a akn:att_3__hc_1__para_27__subpara_b akn:att_3__hc_1__para_28 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_28__subpara_a akn:att_3__hc_1__para_28__subpara_b
GIVEN `members consenting` IS A NUMBER, members IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Dafna may be wound up` `members consenting` members IF
    `members consenting` AT LEAST 75% TIMES members

`no Dafna dividend` MEANS
    PARTY `the Dafna company`
    SHANT `distribute a Dafna dividend`

-- akn:att_3__hc_1__para_28__subpara_b/t1 The articles' signatories; no rule.

§§ `examples`

-- The contract's own rates within the articles, and the summary's within
-- the plan: §8's 0.7% is within §24(א)'s 1%, and §17 of the articles
-- carries 3(ב)–(ג) of the summary as signed.
#ASSERT `a Dafna management fee is within the articles` `the Dafna management fee`
#ASSERT `the Dafna plan's benefits rate, each` EQUALS `the Dafna employer's benefits rate`
#ASSERT `the Dafna plan's benefits rate, each` EQUALS `the Dafna teacher's benefits rate`
#ASSERT `the Dafna plan's special-account rate` EQUALS `the Dafna employer's special-fund rate`

#ASSERT `the Dafna employer's contributions` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 1984) 3000 EQUALS 400
#ASSERT `the Dafna teacher's contribution` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 1984) 3000 EQUALS 150
#ASSERT `the Dafna teacher's contribution` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 1984) 3000 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the special payment by 1(ג)` 120000 8000 EQUALS 2000
#ASSERT `the Dafna special payment on 31.8.84` 120000 8000 EQUALS 1996
#ASSERT `the Dafna special payment on the day it is paid` 120000 240000 8000 EQUALS 3992
#ASSERT `owed the Dafna summary's special payment` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 1984) TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `owed the Dafna summary's special payment` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 1984) TRUE
#ASSERT `the Dafna term that began that year ends on` 0 EQUALS DATE_FROM_DMY 30 9 1985
#ASSERT `the notice ends the Dafna contract at that term's end` (DATE_FROM_DMY 30 6 1990) 5
#ASSERT NOT `the notice ends the Dafna contract at that term's end` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 7 1990) 5
#ASSERT `the Dafna committee decides` (`a Dafna side votes for` 4 4) (`a Dafna side votes for` 4 4)
#ASSERT NOT `the Dafna committee decides` (`a Dafna side votes for` 3 4) (`a Dafna side votes for` 4 4)
#ASSERT `the days of notice of a Dafna meeting` TRUE FALSE EQUALS 21
#ASSERT `a Dafna meeting has its quorum` 2 (10%)
#ASSERT `the quorum of Dafna's board` 5 NOTHING EQUALS JUST 3
#ASSERT `the quorum of Dafna's board` 3 NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Dafna may be wound up` 75 100
#ASSERT NOT `Dafna may be wound up` 74 100
#ASSERT `a Dafna class's rights may change` 75 100
#ASSERT `who takes the Dafna account` TRUE TRUE EQUALS `the survivors under the Severance Pay Law, for Dafna`
#ASSERT `the tax Dafna deducts from` `taxable under rule 3(2), for Dafna` EQUALS 25%
#ASSERT `Dafna keeps the yield §6(א) asks` (5%) FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `Dafna keeps the yield §6(א) asks` (4%) FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `a Dafna deposit linked to the index` 100 200 220 EQUALS 110
